# Copy to `.env` and paste your own key.
#
# Create a free project at https://torii.so, then copy the sandbox publishable
# key (it starts with `pk_test_`). This repo deliberately ships no working key:
# creating your own project is the thing the example demonstrates, and a shared
# key would put other people's sign-ups in someone else's tenant.
#
# Publishable keys are safe in client-side code and in public repos — they are
# not secrets. The key your backend uses (`sk_test_` / `sk_live_`) is, and never
# belongs in a Vite app.
VITE_TORII_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
